  "summary": "Deprecates the legacy watch-only options across several wallet RPCs (`fundrawtransaction`, `walletcreatefundedpsbt`, `send`, `sendall`, and `simulaterawtransaction`). Passing `includeWatching`, `include_watching`, or `include_watchonly` now throws an `RPC_METHOD_DEPRECATED` error unless `-deprecatedrpc=watchonly` is enabled. It also removes an obsolete `-deprecatedrpc=removeprunedfunds` flag from a functional test and fixes a typo in `doc/managing-wallets.md`.",
  "problem": "Multiple wallet RPCs accept watch-only parameters that have been inert no-ops since commit 1337c72198a7d32935431d64e9e58c12f9003abc. RPC clients passing these arguments receive no indication that the options have no effect and will eventually be removed.",
